WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
Three volunteers.

2
00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:02.960
One gurdwara.

3
00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:05.580
Pages and pages of notes.

4
00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.740
The time you arrived.

5
00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.380
The colour of the carpets.

6
00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.680
The menu.

7
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:14.670
And one volunteer saying: I
serve because it removes my ego.

8
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.520
Sikhs call this kind of service sewa.

9
00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:21.830
So how do you turn what people
told you into real analysis?

10
00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:25.490
In this mission, you'll sort
scattered notes into a few themes,

11
00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.000
step by step.

12
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.450
Then you'll judge your own evidence.

13
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.610
Did a leader choose whom you met?

14
00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:34.510
Did people give the answer
they thought you wanted?

15
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.630
Your mission: find out how to turn what
people told you into real analysis.
